ode \\\"66\\\") (name \\\"unconnected-(U4-VBAT-Pad1)\\\") (class \\\"Default\\\") (node (ref \\\"U4\\\") (pin \\\"1\\\") (pinfunction \\\"VBAT\\\") (pintype \\\"power_in+no_connect\\\")))\"}], \"impact\": \"The VBAT domain (RTC and backup registers) may be unpowered, which can cause the MCU to fail to start or to lose RTC and backup state.\", \"confidence\": 0.25}], \"summary\": \"Most of the netlist matches the spec's intent, but the OLED's VCC logic-supply pin is isolated from the board rail, with only a bulk cap on it, and the MCU's VBAT pin is left floating. The first is the more likely real deviation; the VBAT point may simply reflect the reference design.\"}",
